# Normalize line endings to LF for this repo regardless of the machine's
# global core.autocrlf — added after a CRLF flip in several source files
# transiently broke src/lib/__tests__/mealEntriesInsertSites.test.ts, whose
# structural check regexes assume bare \n. See that incident's cleanup
# commit for the full story.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never run line-ending conversion on these; doing so
# corrupts the file.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
